Cell["\<\
Assuming pab0=1/N, only the latter is relevant (the system cannot spend time \
below this frequency if it will fix).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.715373068136392*^9, 3.715373099613536*^9}, {
  3.940314054438485*^9, 
  3.9403140547980947`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"928d5b2b-f969-4d7b-ae42-\
bda7b903e63b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "By comparison, the time spent at frequency x in the deterministic process \
is given by: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FractionBox["1", 
   RowBox[{"\[Psi]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "-", "x"}], ")"}], " ", "x", " "}]]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.5384176012668543`*^9, 3.538417624578463*^9}, 
    3.5384177341087027`*^9, 3.538418297755794*^9, 3.538418396304264*^9, {
    3.538418727332882*^9, 3.538418755178636*^9}, 3.53841889808648*^9, 
    3.5384190196830072`*^9, 3.5384282176050777`*^9, 3.5384283121660748`*^9, 
    3.7153681522045183`*^9},ExpressionUUID->
  "437e6b33-6330-420c-89af-c0744c638cd6"],
 " (this is obtained by rearranging dx/dt = sx(1-x) and then measuring time \
in units of N generations).  "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.715373211115893*^9, 3.7153732322867107`*^9}, {
  3.715373281189666*^9, 3.715373288640683*^9}, {3.715373323237982*^9, 
  3.715373369401412*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e1623383-6154-4b6d-a507-\
bcb45bad5172"],

Cell["\<\
A simple estimate of the acceleration is given by taking the time spent at \
x=pab0 in the diffusion process and equating this to the time in the \
deterministic process at an accelerated position x=\[Alpha] pab0.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.715373588802499*^9, 3.715373654853674*^9}, {
  3.7153776483453217`*^9, 3.715377648697249*^9}, {3.940314050230095*^9, 
  3.940314058884776*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b7552024-600e-4b4a-9156-\
e1d47efb0f13"],

